        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: That Darn Cat!, Perri, The Love Bug, The Million Dollar Duck, Beethoven\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions\n- People: Dean Jones, Felix Salten\n- Topics: films, literary adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- \"Perri\" is a 1957 film from Walt Disney Productions.\n- \"Perri\" is based on Felix Salten's 1938 work \"Perri: The Youth of a Squirrel\".\n- Dean Jones played a role in \"That Darn Cat!\" in 1965.\n- Dean Jones played Jim Douglas in \"The Love Bug\" in 1968.\n- Dean Jones played Albert Dooley in \"The Million Dollar Duck\" in 1971.\n- Dean Jones received a Golden Globe nomination for \"The Million Dollar Duck\".\n- Dean Jones played Dr. Herman Varnick in \"Beethoven\" in 1992.",
